expression: command.clone().render_long_help().to_string()
---
Remove one setting from specforge.json: it reverts to its preset or default

Usage: specforge settings unset [OPTIONS] <EXTENSION> <NAME>

Arguments:
  <EXTENSION>
          The extension, as `specforge settings` lists it

  <NAME>
          The setting's name, or a family's key (`models.planning`)

Options:
      --path <PATH>
          A path inside the project (the nearest directory at or above it holding specforge.json; none: the directory itself, with the default configuration)
          
          [default: .]

      --dry-run
          Report what would be written; write nothing

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format: human or json
          
          [default: human]
          [possible values: human, json]

  -h, --help
          Print help
